abstract: >-
  Shareable inputs, code, methods and expected tables behind Research Snacks,
  short public checks of claims against primary data. Each snack can be rerun
  with uv run check.py. Code is MIT; our text and derived data are CC BY 4.0;
  third-party data keep their own terms (see LICENCE.md and DATA-SOURCES.md).
keywords:
  - research snacks
